## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a streaming, low-latency PCA solution with drift handling and actionable signals.

## Key Concepts
- Incremental PCA for streams
- Imputation strategies under latency bounds
- Variance-based component selection and drift monitoring
- Mapping loadings to alert rules and governance constraints

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo streaming PCA
const ipca = new IncrementalPCA({nComponents: 8});
for (const batch of stream) {
  ipca.partialFit(batch.features);
  const z = ipca.transform(batch.features);
}
```

