## Why This Is Asked
Real-time PCA with drift and robust handling is critical in production analytics.

## Key Concepts
- Streaming PCA with online imputation
- Robust covariance for non-Gaussian data
- Concept drift detection and component update cadence
- Translating loadings into governance-safe alerts under latency constraints

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: incremental_pca_update(window, prev_loadings, ...)
function incremental_pca_update(window){
  const imputed = online_impute(window);
  const cov = robust_cov(imputed);
  const {loadings} = update_pca_from_cov(cov, prev_loadings);
  return loadings;
}
```

